List the models available to your account.

Mirrors `GET /v1/models`, so `client.models.list()` works unchanged.

**Example Response:**
```json
{
    "object": "list",
    "data": [
        {"id": "djelia-asr-v2", "object": "model", "created": 1735689600, "owned_by": "djelia"},
        {"id": "djelia-tts-v2", "object": "model", "created": 1735689600, "owned_by": "djelia"}
    ]
}
```
